                "text": "Nearly 167K women, children, and infants in Jersey \u2014 and close to 7M across the country \u2014 are at risk of losing nutrition assistance during a shutdown.\n\nThe @ProbSolveCaucus put forth a bipartisan plan to stop a shutdown and help hard-working families. https://t.co/Uq8OFTVCTg",
