                "text": "In the House, @RepLCD & I introduced the bipartisan SNAP Nutrition Security Act of 2023. @SenBooker & @SenMarcoRubio introduced it in the Senate.\n\nOur bill helps us understand food affordability & get healthier foods to SNAP recipients, including millions of children & seniors.",
