                "text": "In Jersey, nearly 200K children & 800K+ people face hunger, but far-right extremists want to cut anti-hunger nutrition programs for babies, children, & families in need.\n\nWe need to combat hunger here in NJ and across our nation, not only on Giving Tuesday, but every day.",
